vkminer
=======

Maintainer

  tpfue <https://github.com/tpfuemp>


Inherited code
--------------

vkminer's Stratum client, JSON-RPC layer, option and configuration parsing,
share accounting and logging come from cpuminer-opt, and through it from
pooler's cpuminer and Jeff Garzik's original cpuminer. The GPU backend, the
compute shaders and every hash implementation in this tree are new work.

One exception, and it is not inherited but vendored: third_party/ethash is the
Ethash/ProgPoW CPU reference from RavenCommunity's cpp-kawpow, itself a fork of
Pawel Bylica's chfast/ethash, Copyright 2018-2019 Pawel Bylica and licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (third_party/ethash/LICENSE). It is the host half
of this family's correctness story; the shaders that compute it on a device are
this project's own. See third_party/VERSIONS for the pinned revision.

